# ── Mittelstand engine — still in development, must never ship ──
# The BE integration (app/services/campaigns/mittelstand_service.py,
# app/api/v1/mittelstand.py) imports this package optionally and no-ops
# without it, so ignoring it here is enough to keep the feature out of any
# build/deploy by construction, not just by discipline.
/mittelstand/